{"id":"vod_bf_10524","vodId":"10524","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"钢之炼金术师FA","name_cn":"钢之炼金术师FA","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-11/e2923e407d0dda319c68ccf5eda8c100.jpg"},"summary":"炼金术，一种建立在等价交换原则基础上的科学，将物质进行理解、分解、再构造，将一种物品变成另外一种。但是，这样先进的技术却不能进行人体炼成，这是炼金术绝对的禁忌。可是，拥有极高炼金术天赋的爱德华（朴璐美 配音）和阿尔冯斯（钉宫理恵 配音）兄弟，因为对母亲极大的思念不惜触犯禁忌。而最终的代价却是，爱德华失去了一条手臂和一条腿，弟弟阿尔冯斯只能将灵魂依附在一副巨大的装甲之内。终于明白一切的兄弟俩，为了恢复原状，寻求更多的炼金术知识，成为国家炼金术师踏上了寻找终极炼金物品——贤者之石的旅程。在不断的探索中，两兄弟终于发现了贤者之石背后的真相，对身处的这个军事化国家也有了更深入的了解。此时，面对国家、民族、家庭……炼金术的未来究竟在何处。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,动画,奇幻,冒险,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:24:07","classic":true,"classicRank":9,"franchise":"钢之炼金术师","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushiFA/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/gangzhilianjinshushi